{"3244490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "欧酱的迷宫大冒险", "steam_appid": 3244490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a procedural generation case study for our UE5 online course, Period 8. We created a maze generation pipeline in Houdini and added scenes, props, traps, and other content to the scene using HDA in Unreal. The game took about a month to create, and our main goal was to showcase the diversity of maze components. We hope you enjoy our little game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Face various monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244490/extras/091fdbc5160b06fcb0de6c6ae7111dcb.avif?t=1728550924\" width=512 height=286 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244490/extras/efe099d8b5909e0e81b79e6c4b369e42.avif?t=1728550924\" width=512 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Explore and collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244490/extras/676fc29e38c1ebe7635d0ca61bdd295e.avif?t=1728550924\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a procedural generation case study for our UE5 online course, Period 8. We created a maze generation pipeline in Houdini and added scenes, props, traps, and other content to the scene using HDA in Unreal. The game took about a month to create, and our main goal was to showcase the diversity of maze components. We hope you enjoy our little game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·Face various monsters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.